\ tests/cm/closures.4 - the command model's prototype, step 1 (855): the draft's own examples built by
\ hand on cm/rt-cm.4, and the collector run at every awkward moment. No front end yet: each word below
\ is what a compiler would make of the line in its comment.
S" cm/rt-cm.4" INCLUDED
: KEY$ ( c-addr u --- item )   R-TEXT K-TEXT R-BOX ;
: N. ( item --- )   D>N . ;
: CALL-AT ( map c-addr u --- i*x )   KEY$ D-AT BLK-CALL ;

\ def counter {|start| var n $start; put [inc: { set n $(( $n + 1 )) }  get: { put $n }] }
: CTR-INC ( --- )   0 E@  DUP UPV@ D>N 1+ D-NUM  SWAP UPV! ;
: CTR-GET ( --- item )   0 E@ UPV@ ;
: COUNTER ( start --- map )   \ slot 0: n, captured - its upvalue; slot 1: the map being made
  2 FRAME  UPV-NEW 0 LS!  R-NEW-RECORD K-REC R-BOX 1 LS!
  R-GC                                          \ a collection inside the def: its frame must hold
  1 LS@ S" inc" KEY$  0 LS@ 1 ['] CTR-INC BLK-NEW  D-SET
  1 LS@ S" get" KEY$  0 LS@ 1 ['] CTR-GET BLK-NEW  D-SET
  1 LS@ UNFRAME ;
VARIABLE C1  C1 R-ITEM R-ROOT   VARIABLE C2  C2 R-ITEM R-ROOT
5 D-NUM COUNTER C1 !   100 D-NUM COUNTER C2 !   R-GC
C1 @ S" inc" CALL-AT  R-GC   C1 @ S" inc" CALL-AT  R-GC   C2 @ S" inc" CALL-AT  R-GC
.( two counters, two n's: ) C1 @ S" get" CALL-AT N.  C2 @ S" get" CALL-AT N. CR

\ a collection while a block runs: its captures reached through the blocks running
: CTR-INC-GC ( --- )   R-GC  0 E@  DUP UPV@ D>N 1+ D-NUM  SWAP UPV! ;
C1 @ S" bump" KEY$  C1 @ S" get" KEY$ D-AT CELL+ @ 2 CELLS + @ 1 ' CTR-INC-GC BLK-NEW  D-SET
C1 @ S" bump" CALL-AT  R-GC
.( a collection inside a block: ) C1 @ S" get" CALL-AT N. CR

\ def make {|| var self [:]; set self[me] { put $self }; put $self } - a map, a block, an upvalue, a cycle
: SELF-ME ( --- item )   0 E@ UPV@ ;
: MAKE-CYCLE ( --- map )
  1 FRAME  0 UPV-NEW 0 LS!  R-NEW-RECORD K-REC R-BOX 0 LS@ UPV!
  0 LS@ UPV@ S" me" KEY$  0 LS@ 1 ['] SELF-ME BLK-NEW  D-SET
  0 LS@ UPV@ UNFRAME ;
VARIABLE C3  C3 R-ITEM R-ROOT   MAKE-CYCLE C3 !  R-GC  R-GC
.( a cycle kept, itself after two collections: ) C3 @ S" me" CALL-AT C3 @ = . CR

\ 200,000 cycles made and dropped, the collector run as a safe point would: none of them kept
G-RUNS @ VARIABLE RUNS0  RUNS0 !
: CYCLES ( n --- )   0 ?DO  MAKE-CYCLE DROP  R-GC?  LOOP ;
200000 CYCLES  R-GC
.( collections ran: ) G-RUNS @ RUNS0 @ > .  .( the arena after them under 1 MB: ) R-TOP @ R-ARENA0 @ - 1048576 < . CR
.( and the counters still count: ) C1 @ S" inc" CALL-AT  C1 @ S" get" CALL-AT N.  C2 @ S" get" CALL-AT N. CR
